1. You start at Pacific Heights at 09:00. You immediately travel (8 minutes) to Nob Hill and wait until 09:15 to meet Sandra (09:15–10:15; 60 minutes minimum).

2. At 10:15 you leave Nob Hill; an 8‐minute trip gets you to the Financial District by about 10:23. You then meet Carol from 10:23 to 11:23 (meeting her for the required 60 minutes within her 10:15–12:00 window).

3. Departing at 11:23, you take a 22‐minute ride to Presidio arriving about 11:45 so you can start Brian’s 75‑minute meeting from 11:45 to 13:00 (his window is 10:00–21:30).

4. At 13:00 you leave Presidio and make the 7‑minute trip to Richmond District (arrival ≈13:07). Since Kimberly is available only from 14:15, you wait and then meet her from 14:15 to 14:45 (30 minutes minimum).

5. Immediately at 14:45, you travel 16 minutes from Richmond District to The Castro (arrival ≈15:01) to meet Kenneth from 15:01 to 15:31 (30 minutes meeting within his 14:45–16:15 window).

6. At 15:31, you head to Mission District (a 7‑minute trip, arriving at ≈15:38) and, after waiting until her window begins at 16:15, you meet Laura from 16:15 to 16:45 (30 minutes).

7. Leaving Mission District at 16:45, you ride 19 minutes to Marina District (arrival ≈17:04) and wait until Linda’s availability starts at 18:00. You then meet Linda at Marina from 18:00 to 18:30 (30 minutes).

8. At 18:30 you depart Marina District for Russian Hill (an 8‑minute trip, arriving ≈18:38) where you meet Karen from 18:38 to 19:53 (75 minutes, as required).

9. Finally, you leave Russian Hill at 19:53 to travel 15 minutes to Alamo Square (arrival at ≈20:08), wait until 21:00, and meet Paul from 21:00 to 21:15 (15 minutes meeting within his short window).

This itinerary respects all travel times and each friend’s availability/minimum meeting time while maximizing the number of friends you see for the day.
